// 0 cd/m², and R=G=B=1.0 corresponds to BT.2100/PQ system 80 cd/m².
// The maximum is R=G=B=125.0 corresponding to 10k cd/m².
//
// Windows-scRGB is displayed by Windows 10 by converting it to
